# amont-agent-cases-v1
# Reviewed judgements for cd-carries-over. The rule is `Examine::Live`: its
# verdict is `confirm`'s, from the batch in the session transcript, so a
# replay never fires it. These cases pin that, including the commands the
# live rule would let through to `confirm`.
nomatch	pwd
nomatch	git status
nomatch	cd relative/dir && pwd
nomatch	(cd /repo && git status)
nomatch	cd /repo && git status
nomatch	pushd /repo && make
nomatch	cd /Users/me/work && git log
